                                    <li style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:10px; font-size:0.875rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">
                                        ✓ Weed &amp; pest control
                                    </li>
                                    <li style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:10px; font-size:0.875rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">
